# Sound with no ear (T-653): the output sink's monitor read for a second, its level, and the speaker amp.
id: flash-sound
section: The engine
item: Flash with sound (jihad-audio-long), and a video with sound, on the engine (a signal at the output sink for each; silence between them)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.media.autoplayWithSound=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-tone.html
kit: cavekit-engine-update.md R8
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
expect audio audible 20
expect sound heard 10
launch about:blank
expect sound silent 10
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1&sound=1
wait text status playing 20
expect sound heard 10
